		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Humanoid avatar of a nature spirit or demigod. Champion of that god's cause. Only one animal lord per species at any time.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16 (+1 leather), <strong>HP</strong> 38, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +6 (1d6) or 2 +1 longbow (far) +6 (1d8+1), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Leap</strong>. Jump up to near in height and double near in distance, then make 2 bite attacks.</p><p></p><p><strong>Nature Spirit</strong>. Can instantly transform into panther or back into humanoid. Leaves no tracks.</p><p></p><p><strong>Stealthy</strong>. ADV on checks to sneak and hide.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
